<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1 Korinth</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Korinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Krista Isua tirhkoh ni tûra Pathian duhzâwng anga koh leh, kan unaupa Sosthena chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Korinth khuaa Pathian kohhran awm, mi thianghlim ni tûra koh, Krista Isuaa tihthianghlim leh hmun tina kan Lalpa Isua Krista, (anni leh keini Lalpa) hming lam zawng zawng chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin Krista Isuaa khawngaihna a pêk che u avâng hian in chungthu-ah ka Pathian hnênah eng lai pawhin lâwmthu ka sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amahah chuan kawng tinrêngin tihhausak in ni a, thu-ah leh hriatna tinrêngah in ṭhang zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista thu kan hril khân nangmahniah zung a kai nghet ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tichuan, kan Lalpa Isua Krista lo lan in nghah chhûng hian thlarau lam thilpêk eng mah in tlachham lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista nia sawisêlbova awm tûrin a tâwp thlengin a tinghet ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Fapa, kan Lalpa Isua Krista pâwlnaa ko lûttu che u Pathian chu a rinawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute u, kan Lalpa Isua Krista hmingin ka ngên a che u, in zîngah inṭhenna awm lovin thukhat vua ula, rilru thuhmun leh ngaih dân hmun khat neiin awm khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka unaute u, in zîngah inngeih lohna a awm tih Kloii chhûngten mi rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu chu ka han sawi ang e: “Kei Paula pâwl ka ni, kei Apolova pâwl ka ni, kei Kifa pâwl ka ni, kei Krista pâwl ka ni,” mi tinin in tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Krista chu ṭhenin a awm em ni? In tân Paula chu khenbeh a ni em ni? A nih loh leh Paula hmingin baptisma in chang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krispa leh Gaia lo chu in zîngah tu mah ka baptis loh avângin ka lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuten emaw ka hminga baptisma chang angin an sawi dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Stefana chhûngte pawh ka baptis tak e. Chûng mite tih loh chu mi dang ka baptis emaw ka hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista chuan baptis tûrin mi tîr lo va, Chanchin Ṭha hril tûrin mi tîr zâwk a ni si a. Thufing hmanga hril tûrin mi tîr lo, chutilo chu Krista kraws hi engmah lovah an ngai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kraws thu chu boral mêkte tân chuan thu âtthlâk a ni, keini chhandam mêkte tân erawh chuan Pathian thiltihtheihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Mi fing finna ka tiboral ang a, Mi thiam thiamna chu ka hnâwl bâwk ang,’ tia ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi fing chu khawiah nge? Dân hremi chu khawiah nge? Tûnlai thila hnial thiam chu khawiah nge? Pathianin khawvêl finna hi thil âtthlâkah a siam ta a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian finna chu hei hi a ni, khawvêlin finna hmanga Pathian an hriat theih loh hnuin, kan thu hril âtthlâk hmanga ringtute chhandam hi: chu chu Pathian lâwmzâwng tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda-te chuan chhinchhiahna thil mak an phût kher a. Grik-te lahin finna ngawt an zawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keini erawh chuan Krista khenbeh thu kan hril a ni, chu chu Juda-te tân chuan dâltu a ni a, Jentail-te tân thil âtthlâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda pawh ni se, Grik pawh ni se, kohte tân chuan Krista chu Pathian finna leh thiltihtheihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian âtna chu mihring finna aiin a fing zâwk a, a chak lohna pawh mihring chakna aiin a chak zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute u, a koh dân che u hi ngaihtuah teh u, in zînga tam tak hi tisa lama mi fing in ni lo va, mi thiltithei tak pawh in ni lo va, mi ropui chhûng zînga mi pawh in ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian chuan khawvêl mite ngaiha thil âte chu mi fingte tihmualpho nân a thlang a, khawvêla thil chak lote chu thil chakte tihmualpho nân a thlang bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tin, thil awm sate paihthlâk nân khawvêl thil mâwl leh hmusitawmte, thil awm lote nên lam Pathianin a thlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian hmaah chuan tu mah inchhuang thei an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangni zawng, Pathian zârah, Krista Isuaah chuan in awm ta a; ani chu Pathian hnên ata kan tân finna te, thiam chantîrna te, tihthianghlimna te leh tlanna te a lo ni ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tichuan, an ziak angin, “Chhuan tûr duh chuan Lalpa chu chhuang rawh se.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei zawng unaute u, Pathian thu ril puang tûra in hnêna ka lo kal khân, thu thiam bîk leh fing bîk angin ka lo kal loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In zînga ka awm chhûngin Isua Krista leh Krawsa khenbeh a nih thu chauh lo chu eng dang mah hria nih ka tum loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In zîngah chak lo takin, hlau leh khûr chungin ka awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka thu sawiah leh thu hrilah thu sawi tlawr leh thu fing hmang lovin, Thlarau leh a thiltihtheihna tilang zâwngin ka sawi zâwk ṭhîn a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mihring finnaa innghat lova, Pathian thiltihtheihnaa in innghah zâwk nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puitling zîngah zawng thu fing kan sawi ṭhîn, tûnlai mite finna hi a ni lo va, an hotu, tlâwm mai tûrte finna lah a ni bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu fing inthup kan sawi hi Pathian thu ril, kan ropuina tûra leilung pian hmaa Pathianin a lo ruat lâwk tawh chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu he khawvêl rorêltu tu mahin an hre lo, hria sela ropuina Lalpa chu an khêngbet lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in: “Mita la hmuh ngai loh, benga la hriat ngai loh, Mihring rilrua lût ngai lo, amah hmangaihtute tâna Pathianin a buatsaihsak chu,” a tih kha kan hril zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng chu kan hnênah Pathianin Thlarauvin a rawn puang ta a; a ni, Thlarau chuan engkim, Pathian rilru thûk pawh a hre vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihring rilru chhûngril chu amaha awm thlarau chauh lo chuan tuin nge hria? Chutiang bawkin Pathian rilru chhûngril pawh Pathian Thlarau ngawt lo chuan tu man an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêl thlarau kan dawng lo va, Pathian Thlarau, Pathian hnêna mi kan dawng zâwk a ni, Pathian thilthlâwnpêkte kan hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihring finna an inzirtîr ṭhin chu hmang lovin, Thlarau zirtîrna hmangin thu kan sawi zâwk a, thlarau mite hnênah thlarau lam thil kan sawi fiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tisa mi chuan Pathian Thlarau lam thil eng mah a lâwm lo, a tân chuan âtthlâk mai a ni, thlarau chauhva hriat theih a nih avângin a hre thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlarau mi erawh chuan thil engkim a thliar thiam a; ani lah chu tu man an hrethiam pha si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa rilru chu tu nge hriaa, amah chu zirtîr thei? Keini zawngin Krista rilru kan pu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, thlarau mite hnêna sawi angin in hnênah thu ka sawi thei lo va; tisa mi, Krista rinnaa nausênte hnêna sawi angin ka sawi zâwk ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In la ei theih loh avângin chaw rum ni lovin, hnute tuiin ka châwm ṭhîn che u a; tûn thleng pawhin in la ei theih loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In la tisa mi hle a ni. In zîngah inîtsîkna leh inerna a awm chhûng chuan tisa mi, mihring taka la khawsa in ni tihna a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In zîngah, “Kei Paula pâwl ka ni, kei chu Apolova pâwl ka ni,” tite in la awm chhûng chuan in tisa mi hle tihna a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nih leh Apolova chu tu nge a nih? Paula pawh chu tu nge a nih? In rin theihna tûra rawngbâwltu mai an ni asin; chu pawh chu Lalpan a pêk ang zêlin an thawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keiin ka phun a, Apolovan tuiin a châwm a; nimahsela, Pathianin a ṭhantîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhantîrtu Pathian chauh lo chu, a phuntu leh tuia châwmtu chu eng mah an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A phuntu leh tuia châwmtu chu hna thuhmun thawk an ni. An thawhrim dân athuin lâwmman an hmu ve ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian tâna thawk dûn kan ni si a, nangni hi Pathian thlawhhma chu in ni e. Pathian in sak chu in ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianin khawngaihna min pêk hmangin, in satu themthiam remhre tak angin a lungphûm ka phûm a, chumi chungah chuan mi dangin an rawn sa a; amaherawhchu, an sak dân hmangah fîmkhur ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lung rem tawh sa lo chu tu man lungphûm dang an phûm thei ta lo, chu lungphûm chu Isua Krista hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi chungah chuan miin rangkachakin emaw, tangkaruain emaw, lungmantamin emaw, thingin emaw, hnimin emaw, buhpâwlin emaw in sa sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mi tin hna thawh ṭhat leh ṭhat loh dân a la lang fiah ang; Krista ni chuan a la tilang dâwn si a, meia a inlâr dâwn avângin. Mei chuan mi tin hnathawh chu a fiah ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in sak pawh a kan loh chuan, chu mi chuan lâwmman a hmu ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tu in sak pawh a kan chuan, chu mi chuan a chân ang, amah tak erawh chu chhanhim a ni hrâm ang, mei kan hnu ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian chênna in chu in ni tih leh Pathian Thlarau nangmahniah a chêng reng tih in hre lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin chu in chu an tihkhawloh chuan, Pathianin anni chu a tikhawlo ve ang; Pathian chênna in chu a thianghlim si a, chu in chu in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu man mahni inbum suh se. In zînga tu pawh he khawvêl ngaiha fing nia a inhriat chuan, a lo fin tak tak theih nân â phawt rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />he khawvêl finna hi Pathian ngaihin âtthlâk a ni si a. “Ani chuan mi fingte chu anmahni fin vervêknain a âwk a,” tih ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Lalpa chuan mi fingte ngaihtuahna chu engmah lo mai a ni tih a hria,” tih a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, tu man mihringte hi chhuang suh se, engkim hi in ta vek a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paula emaw, Apolova emaw, Kifa emaw, khawvêl emaw, nunna emaw, thihna emaw, tûn hun emaw, nakin hun emaw, azain in ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangni pawh Krista ta in ni a, Krista pawh chu Pathian ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keini hi Krista rawngbâwltu, Pathian thu ril enkawltua ngaih tûr kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Enkawltu atâna ruatte chu an rinawm phawt tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangnin emaw, mi dangin emaw min fiahna hi engah mah ka ngai lo va, keimah lah ka infiah ngai hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />eng mah indemna tûr ka hre si lo, sawisêlbo ka ni tihna zawng a ni lêm lo, mi fiahtu chu Lalpa a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa lo kal leh hma loh chu, a hun lovah tu mah sawisêl suh u, chutih hunah chuan thima thuhrûkte chu a rawn tilang ang a, mi tinin mahni phu tâwkah Pathian fak an hlawh ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute u, hêng thu, “Thu ziak chu khûm suh u,” tih hi in zir theih nân kei leh Apolova hi in entawn atân ka han intârlang a ni, tu mahin pakhat chhuanga pakhat in thlauhthlâk loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in nge mi dang aia danglam bîkah siam che? A thlâwna in dawn tih loh eng nge in neih? Chuti a nih si chuan i dawn ni lo ang maia engtizia nge i uanpui le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In hnianghnâr ta a ni maw? In hausa ta hle mai maw? Kan tel lovin in lal ta hle em ni? Lal tak tak ula kan va ti êm, in zârah kan han lal ve tûr!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian hian keini tirhkohte hi thi tûra ruatte ang maiin lei leh vâna vântirhkohte leh mi zawng zawngin ennawma an en huai huai atân, a hnuhnûng berah min dah niin ka hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keini zawng Krista avângin mi â kan ni a, nangni erawh chu Krista zârah mi fing in ni. Keini kan chak lo va, nangni in chak thung a, keini chu miten min hmusit a, nangni zawng an ngaisâng che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûn thleng pawh hian rilṭâm leh tuihâlin kan awm a, silhfên kan tlachham a, mi kut kan tuar a, kan vâkvai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuta rim taka thawkin ei kan zawng a, miin ânchhia min lawhin mal kan sâwm thung a, min tihduhdah leh chhel takin kan tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min chêksawlh leh ṭha takin kan chhâng a. Tûn thleng pawh hian khawvêl bawlhhlawh chhêk khâwm hnâwmhnawk ang leka ngaih kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng hi in zah nâna ziak ka ni lo, ka fa duh takte anga zilh nân che u ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krista lama kaihruaitu che u a sîng têl nei mah ula, pa zawng pakhat chauh in nei, kei hi Kristaa in pa, Isua chanchin Ṭhaa rawn hringtu che u ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi entawn tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hei vâng hian ka fa duh tak, Lalpaa mi rinawm Timothea chu in hnênah ka rawn tîr a ni; ani chuan hmun tina Kohhran kan zirtîr ṭhin anga Isua Kristaa ka khawsak dân a rawn hriat nawntîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei in hnêna lo kal leh lo tûr ang hrimin ṭhenkhat chu in uang hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpan rem a tih chuan ka rawn tlawh thuai dâwn a che u; chutih hunah chuan hêng mi uangte hian eng nge an sawi, tih mai ni lovin, eng thiltihtheihna nge an neih tehrêng ka rawn hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ram chu thu maiah a innghat lo va, thiltihtheihnaah a innghat zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A eng nge in duh? Talhfiak nêna ka lo kal nge in duh, thuhnuairawlh tak leh hmangaihna rilru nên?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jentail-te pawhin an duh loh inngaihna bawlhhlawh in zîngah a awm tih thu a thang nasa hle a ni, mi pakhatin a pa nupui a neih kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawi ti hle tûr in ni a, engati nge in la uan theih cheu? In zîng ata chutiang titu chu hnawh chhuah tûr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tisain in zîngah awm lo mah ila, thlarauvin ka awm a, chutiang titu chungchâng chu in zînga awm angin kan Lalpa Isua hmingin ka ngaihtuah fel tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In inkhâwmnaah kei thlarauva in zînga tel ve angin, Lalpa Isua thuneihna hmangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Ni-a a thlarau chhandama a awm theih nân, a tisa tiboral tûrin Setana pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In uanna hi a ṭha lo ve. Dawidim tlêm têin chhang hlâwm a pumin a fan chhuak thei tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dawidim tel lo chhang in lo niha, chhang hlâwm thar hlak in lo nih theih nân dawidim hlui chu thian fai rawh u. Kan Kalhlên kûtna tûr Krista ngei chu hlanin a awm tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, i kût ang u, dawidim hlui, nun chhia leh sual dawidim telh chhang nên ni lovin, thianghlimna leh dikna telh chhang nên i kût zâwk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lehkhaah khân inngaih hmangte pâwl lo tûrin ka ti che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawvêl mi, inngaih hmang te, duhâm te, rûkru te leh milem biate kawmserh tûr ka tihna a ni lo; chuti ni se, khawvêl in chhuahsan a ngai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ringtu, unau zînga tel si, inngaih hmang emaw, duhâm emaw, milem bia emaw, mi hau hmang emaw, zu heh emaw, rûk hmang emaw pâwl lo tûrin, an zîngah ei pawh ei lo tûrin ka ti zâwk che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pâwn lam mite thu chu keia rêl tûr em ni? Pathianin a rêlsak tûr a ni lâwm ni? Chutiang mi sual chu in zîng ata hnawt chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In zînga miin ringtu dang laka thubuai a neihin, ringtute hnêna thlen lovin, engtizia nge ring lote hnêna a thlen ngam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ringtute chuan khawvêl ro an rêl dâwn tih in hre lâwm ni? Khawvêl rorêlsaktu tûrte in nih si chuan, thil tê tham pawh ngaihtuah tlâk lo in ni em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûn dam chhûng thil chu sawi loh, vântirhkohte chungthu pawh kan la rêl dâwn tih in hre lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dam chhûng khawsak thu rêl tûr in neihin, kohhrana enga maha ngaih lohte in rêltîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A va zahthlâk âwm ve! Unau kâra thu rem thei mi fing pakhat tal in zîngah an awm lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutia ring lo mite rem atân ringtuin a unau a khin tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thubuai nangmahni zînga in nei ṭhîn hi, Kristian nunah in tling lo let dêr tihna a ni. Engah nge a tlâwm zâwk nih in hreh? A tuar zâwk nih pawh engah nge in hreh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutih ahnêkin mahni unaute pawi khawihtu leh chhuhsaktu in la ni ta zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi dik lote chuan Pathian ram an chang thei dâwn lo tih in hre na nge? Bumin awm suh u, inngaih hmang te, milem bia te, uire te, mi hur te, mawngkawhur te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />rûk hmang te, duhâm te, zu ruih chîng te, mi deu chîng te, hlêprûk chîng te chuan Pathian ram an luah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga ṭhenkhat chutiang mi chu in ni ṭhîn a; nimahsela, Lalpa Isua Krista hmingah leh kan Pathian thlarauvah chuan tlen fai in ni a, tihthianghlim in ni a, thiam chantîr in ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tân engkim a thiang a; mahse, a ṭangkai vek lêm lo, ka tân engkim thiang mah se eng bawihah mah ka inphal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chaw hi pum tân a ni a, pum pawh chu chaw tân a ni; nimahsela, Pathianin a la tiboral ve ve dâwn. Taksa hi inngaih nân a ni lo va, Lalpa tân a ni zâwk, Lalpa pawh chu taksa tân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathianin Lalpa chu a kaitho va, keini pawh chu a thiltihtheihna chuan min kaitho ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In taksa chu Krista taksa pêng a ni tih in hre lo vem ni? Krista taksa pêng lain nawhchizuar pêngah ka siam dâwn em ni? Siam lul lo ve!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miin nawhchizuar a zawm chuan taksa pumkhat an ni ta tih in hre na nge? “An pahnih chuan tisa pumkhat an ni tawh ang,” tih ziak a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa zawmtu erawh chu amah nên thlarau pumkhat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inngaihna sual hi bânsan rawh u. Thil sual dang eng pawh miin an tih chuan, an taksa pâwn lam thil a ni a; inngaihna erawh hi chu mahni taksa chunga thil tihsualna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In taksa hi, ‘in chhûnga awm Pathian hnên aṭanga in hmuh Thlarau Thianghlim chênna in a ni tih in hre na nge? Mahni ta pawh in ni tawh hlei nêm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mana lei in ni tawh asin; chuvângin, in taksa hian Pathian chawimawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In thu han ziak chungchângah chuan: Mipain hmeichhia khawih loh a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, inngaihna a awm ṭhin avângin mipain nupui bîk nei ṭheuh sela, hmeichhia pawhin pasal bîk nei ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasalin a nupui hnêna a tih tûr chu ti sela, chutiang bawkin nupui pawhin a pasal hnêna a tih tûr chu ti ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nupui chuan ama taksa chungah thu a nei lo va, a pasalin a nei zâwk a ni; chutiang bawkin pasal pawhin ama taksa chungah thu a nei lo va, a nupuiin a nei zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭawngṭai tûra in inpêk theih nân rei lo tê atân rem in tih dun chauh loh chuan, a tua mah intidâwng suh u; chumi hnuah chuan in awm dân pangngaiin awm leh thuai ula, chuti lo zawng insûm zawh loh avângin Setanan a thlêm dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a thu pe zâwnga sawi ka ni lo va, a phal zâwnga sawi ka ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng keimah ang hian awm vek se ka duh a; mahse, mi tinin Pathian hnên ata thilpêk bîk kan dawng ṭheuh va, pakhatin kawng khatin, a dangin kawng dangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />La innei lote leh hmeithaite chu keimah angin awm sela a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An insûm theih loh erawh chuan nupui pasal nei mai rawh se, hur aiin inneih a ṭha zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Innei tawhte chu ka thu ni lovin, Lalpa thupêk ka hrilh a che u - nupui chuan a pasal ṭhen suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ṭhen vêk chuan mi dang nei tawh suh se, a nih loh leh a pasal nên an inrem leh tûr a ni; pasal pawhin a nupui ma suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dang hnênah chuan Lalpa thu ni lovin, keimahin sawi tûr ka nei. Ringtuin ring lo mi nupuiah nei sela, a nupui chuan a hnêna awm zêl a duh chuan ṭhen suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ringtu hmeichhia pawhin ring lo mi nei sela, a pasal chuan a hnêna awm zêl a duh chuan a ṭhen kher tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ring lo pa chu a nupui zârah tihthianghlim a ni a, ringlo nu pawh a pasal zârah tihthianghlim a ni bawk. Chuti ni suh se, in fate chu an thianghlim lo vang; nimahsela, an thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ring lo zâwkin ṭhen a duh chuan ṭhen mai rawh se; chutiang thilah tawh chuan ringtu chu, a hmei a pain phuar in ni lo ve; Pathian erawh chuan inrem tûrin a ko che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nute u, in pasalte in chhandam dawn lo tih engtin nge in hriat? Pate u, in nupuite in chhandam dâwn lo tih engtin nge in hriat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tin hi Lalpan an hnêna a sem ang ṭheuh leh, Pathianin a koh laia an awm dân ang ṭheuhvin awm zêl rawh se; chutianga awm tûrin kohhran zawng zawng ka hrilh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Serh tan tawh koh an awm chuan tihbo tum suh se, serh tan loh koh an awm chuan tan suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Serh tan hi eng mah a ni lo va, tan loh pawh eng mah a ni hek lo, a pawimawh chu Pathian thupêk zawm hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tin koh an nih laia an dinhmun ngaiah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawih i nih laiin koh i ni em? Engto tehchiam suh; chhuak thei i nih erawh chuan chhuak mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawih, Lalpa koh chu, Lalpa bawih chhuah a ni; bawih ni lo Lalpa koh chu, Krista bawih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mana lei in ni tawh e, mihring bawihah awm tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Unaute u, mi tin kohva in awm laia in dinhmun ngaiah ṭheuh Pathianah awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nula leh tlangvâl chungchâng thu-ah chuan Lalpa thupêk eng mah ka nei lo va; amaherawhchu, a ngilneihna azâra Lalpa ngaiha rinawm ka nih hi chhuangin ka ngaih dân ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hun harsain min nan tâk avângin mahni awm pangngai anga awm mai ṭha ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nupui nei i nih chuan ṭhen tum suh, nei lo i nih chuan nupui zawng suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nupui i neih pawhin thil i tisual lo ve; nula pawhin pasal a neih chuan thil a tisual lo. Amaherawhchu, nupui pasal neiten harsatna tam tak an tâwk ang, keiin chûng chu pumpelhtîr che u ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Unaute u, hun a tawi tâk êm avângin hei hi ka ti a ni; tûn chinah chuan nupui neite chu nei lo angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />lusûnte chu sûn lo angin, lâwmte chu lâwm lo angin, leitu chu nei lo angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />khawvêl thila inhmangte chu inhmang lo angin awm sela ka duh a ni. He khawvêl awm dân hi a boral mêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lungkham nei lova in awm ka duh a ni. Nupui nei lo chuan Lalpa tilâwm tûrin Lalpa hna a engto va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nupui nei erawh chuan a nupui tihlâwm nân khawvêl thil a engto va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a rilru a phîr ṭhîn. Pasal nei lo hmeichhia leh nula thianghlim chuan an taksa leh an thlarau vawng thianghlim tûrin Lalpa hna chauh an engto va; pasal nei erawh chuan a pasal tihlâwm nân khawvêl thil a engto ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hei hi in tâna sâwt tûr a nih avângin ka sawi a ni; khuahkhirh ka tum che u a ni lo ve, mawi taka in awm theih nân leh Lalpa rawngbâwl tûra in inpumpêk theihna tûrin ka sawi zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin a nupui hual lakah tidik lova a inhriata, lêngṭûl mai tûr a niha, inneih ṭûla a hriat bawk si chuan, a duh ang chuan ti sela, nei mai rawh se, thil a tisual lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nupui nei lo tûra nawr luih ni lova, ama duh thu ang ngeia neih loh tum tlat thei a nih chuan, a duh anga a tih chu a ṭha a, a nupui hual a nei lo chu a ti ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, a nula hual nupuia neitu chuan a ti ṭha e, nei lotu chuan a ti ṭha lehzual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nupui chu a pasal dam chhûng chuan phuar a ni a; a pasal a thih erawh chuan a duh apiang a nei thei ang; amaherawhchu, Lalpaa awm mi a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nei lova a awm ngaia a awm zêl chu a nihlawh zâwk ka ring. Kei pawh Pathian thlarau neiah ka inngai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Milem biakna thil ei thu chu: Kan za-in ‘hriatna’ kan nei ṭheuh tih kan hria a, chutiang ‘hriatna’ chuan mi a tichapo ṭhîn a, hmangaihna erawh chuan mi a siam ṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu pawhin thil hria nia a inngaih chuan a hriat tûr ang a la hre lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miin Pathian a hmangaih erawh chuan Pathian mi hriat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, milem biakna thil hlan ei thu-ah chuan - khawvêlah hian milemte hi eng mah an nih lohzia leh, Pathian pakhat chauh lo chu a dang rêng rêng an awm lohzia kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vânah emaw, leiah emaw pathian anga ngaih tam tak an awm thei a, chutiangin pathian tam tak leh lalpa tam tak an awm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, keini tân zawng Pathian pakhat chauh, Pa, engkim siamtu chu a awm a; keini pawh ama tâna awm kan ni; tin, Lalpa pakhat chauh, Krista chu a awm bawk a; thil engkim hi ama zâra siam a ni a, keini pawh ama zâra awm kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chu hriatna chu mi zawng zawngin an nei vek lêm lo, tûn thlengin mi ṭhenkhat milem be ṭhang an nih avângin an thil ei chu milem hnêna inthawina anga ngaiin an ei ṭhîn a; an chhia leh ṭha hriatna a chak si lo va, bawlhhlawhin an inhre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eng pawh ni se, kan thil ei hian Pathian mit min tluntîr chuang lo; ei lo mah ila kan chhe chuang lo va, ei mah ila kan ṭha chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, fîmkhur rawh u, in zalênna hi engti kawngin emaw rinnaa chak lote tân tlûkna a lo ni hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang, chutiang hriatna nei, milem biakna ina i chaw ei lai, mi, a chhia leh ṭha hriatna chak lovin hmu ta che sela, milem hnêna thil hlante ei a ngam phah ve dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuti a nih chuan i hriatna chu ringtu chak lo tân chhiatna a ni ang asin; ani tân pawh Krista chu a thi si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutianga unaute chunga in tihsuala, an chhia leh ṭha hriatna chu a chak loh nâk alaia, in hliam lehnghâl chuan Krista chunga thil tisual in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, ei leh inin ka unau a tihtlûk si chuan, ka unau chu ka tihtlûk loh nân kumkhuain sa rêng ka ei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zalên ka ni lo vem ni? Tirhkoh ka ni lo vem ni? Kan Lalpa Isua ka hmu tawh a ni lâwm ni? Nangni pawh hi Lalpaa ka hnathawh rahte chu in ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi dangte tân tirhkoh ni kher lo mah ila, nangni tân zawng ka ni. Lalpa mi in ni hi tirhkoh ka nih chhinchhiahna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi sawisêltute chu hetiang hian ka chhâng ṭhîn:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ei leh in tûr kan phût thei lo bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tirhkoh dangte leh Lalpa unaute leh Kifa te angin zinnaah Kristian hmeichhia kan hruai thei lo bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei leh Barnaba hi kut hna thawka inchâwm chawp tûr kan ni bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahni inchâwma sipaia ṭang tu nge awm? A rah ei si lovin tu nge grep huan siam ngai? A hnute ei si lovin tu nge ran vulh ngai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng hi mihring thlîr dân aṭanga sawi ka ni lo ve. Dân thu pawhin hêng hi a sawi lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia Dânah chuan, “Bâwngpain buh a chîl laiin a hmui phuar suh,” tih ziak a ni. Pathianin bâwng tân chauh em ni a sawi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan tâna sawi a ni zâwk lâwm ni? Ni e, kan tâna ziak a ni. Lei lettu chuan beisei neiin let sela, buh chîltu pawhin chan neih ve beiseiin chîl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keinin in zîngah thlarau lam thil tuhin, in hnên ata tisa lam thil seng tel ta pawh ni ila, hlâwk ta lua kan ni bîk dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dangten in laka chutiang an phût theih chuan keini chuan thei lehzual tûr kan ni lâwm ni? Phût thei mah ila kan phût ngai lo. Krista Chanchin Ṭha chu kan dâl loh nân, engkim chhel takin kan tuar hrâm hrâm zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempula rawngbâwltuten tempula thil hlante an ei a, maichâma inthawina hlântute pawhin an thil hlan aṭangin chan an nei ve tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Chanchin Ṭha hi Chanchin Ṭha hriltute ei hmuh nân Lalpan a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, kei chuan a enga mah hi ka chhawr lo, ka chunga chutiang in tih nân hei hi ziak ka ni lo; ka chhuan hi eng mah lova mi siamsak ai chuan ka tân thih a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha hril mah ila, chhuang thei ka ni lo, tihmâkmawh ka chungah a innghat a ni. Chanchin ṭha hi hril lo ila ka chung a va pik dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahni duh thu-a hril ni ila, hlawh pawh ka nei ang chu, mahni duh thu-a hril ka nih si loh chuan Chanchin Ṭha enkawl hna mi pe a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng nge ka hlawh tâk ang le? Chanchin Ṭha hriltu ka nih avânga ka phût theih phût lova a thlâwna Chanchin Ṭha ka hril theihna hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu ma bawih ni lo mah ila, a tam thei ang ber ka lâk theih nân mi tin bawihah ka insiam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda-te ka lâk theih nân Juda-te zîngah Juda mi angin ka awm a; Dân hnuaia awm ni lo mah ila, Dân hnuaia mite ka lâk theih nân Dân hnuaia awm angin ka khawsa ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dân nei lote ka lâk theih nân an zîngah Dân nei lo angin ka awm ṭhîn, Pathian dân zâwm lo ni si lovin, Krista dân zâwm tlat siin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi chak lote ka lâk theih nân an zîngah chak lo angin ka awm ṭhîn. Chutiang chuan, eng emaw ti tala mi ṭhenkhat ka chhandam theih nân mi tin zîngah kawng hrang hrangin ka awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chanvo ka neih ve theih nân Chanchin Ṭha avângin engkim ka ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Intlânsiakho chu theihtâwp chhuahin an tlân ṭhîn a; mahse, pakhat chauhvin lâwmman a hmu ṭhîn tih in hre lâwm ni? Chutiang chuan lâwmman hmu ngei tûrin tlân rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Intlânsiaknaa tel tûrte chu kawng engkimah an insûm ṭhîn, chawimawina lukhum chhe mai thei hmu tûrin an bei a, keini erawh chuan chawimawina lukhum chhe thei lo hmu tûrin kan bei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutiang tak chuan kei pawh pan nei rânin ka tlân a, boruak mai hnek lovin keimah ka inhnek ṭhîn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ka taksa hi ka sawi zawi a, ka thunun a; chutilo chuan, mite hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hriltu ni siin kei hi hnâwlin ka awm hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, min thlahtute chunga thil thlengte kha hre reng rawh u; an za-in chhûm hnuaiah an awm a, tuifinriat Sen pawh an kai vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an vaiin chhûmah leh tuifinriatah Mosia zui tûra baptis an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An za-in thlarau lam chaw thuhmun an ei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an za-in thlarau lam in tûr thuhmun an in bawk a, anmahni châwmtu thlarau lam lungpuia mi tui an in ṭheuh kha; chu lungpui chu Krista hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin an zînga tam zâwk chungah Pathian a lungni lo va, thlalêrah khân an tlûk hlum kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil sual tih an châk anga kan châk ve loh nân chûng chu min zirtîrtu tûr a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhatin milem an bia ang khân milem be suh u, “Mipui chu ei leh in tûrin an ṭhu a, lâm tûrin an tho leh a,” tia ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat an inngai ang khân i inngai ve suh ang u, ni khatah mi sînghnih leh sângthumin an thih phah kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhatin Lalpa an fiah ang khân i fiah ve suh ang u, rûlin a chuk hlum ṭeuh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat Pathian laka an phunnawi ang khân phunnawi suh u, tiboraltuin a tihboral hlawm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng an thil tawhte chu mi dang zilh nân a ni a; keini, hun tâwpa chêngte min zirtîrtu atân ziak a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, tu pawh ding nghet nia inhria chu a tlûk loh nân fîmkhur rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fiahna in tawh ṭhin hi mi tawh bâk a awm chuang lo. Pathian chu a rinawm a, in tawrh theih aia nasa fiahna in chungah a thlentîr lo vang, in do zawh theih nân fiahna lo thlen rualin pumpelhna kawng a siamsak zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka duh takte u, milem biak hi hawisan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil chinchâng hre rual in ni bawk a, ka thu hi ngun takin ngaihtuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Malsâwmna no laa, malsâwmna kan sawi ṭhin hi Krista thisen kan ṭâwmpuina a ni lo vem ni? Chhang kan phel hi Krista taksa kan ṭâwmpuina a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhang chu tlang khat a ni angin, keini hi tam tak ni mah ila, taksa pumkhat kan ni, chhang tlang khata mi kan chang ṭheuh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pianna lama Israel-te hi ngaihtuah teh u, inthawina sa eitute chuan maichâm nên inkûngkaihna an nei lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />He thu-ah hian eng nge sawi ka tum le? Milem hnêna thil hlan chuan hlutna a nei tih leh, milem pawh chuan takna a nei ka tihna em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni suh e, Jentail-te inthawina chu Pathian hnênah ni lovin, ramhuai hnênah a ni tih thu ka sawi a ni. Nangni zawng ramhuai nêna inkûngkaihna in neih ka duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa no leh ramhuai no in in kawp thei lo vang; Lalpa chawhlui leh ramhuai chawhlui in kîl kawp thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chu kan tithinur dâwn zâwk em ni? Ani aiin kan chak zâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Eng pawh tih a thiang,” in ti maw? Tih vek chu a ṭha lêm si lo. “Engkim tih a thiang,” in ti maw? Engkim tihin mi a siam ṭha hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu pawhin mahni ṭhatna tûr mai zawng lovin mi dang ṭhatna tûr zawng zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sa dâwra an zawrh tawh phawt chu dilchhût taka eng mah zâwt lovin ei mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lei leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi Lalpa ta a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ring lo miin chaw eia an sâwm che ua, kal in duh si chuan, dîlchhût taka zâwt lovin an hlui apiang che u chu ei mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tuin emaw, “Hei hi chu inthawina thil a ni,” tia a hrilh che u chuan, a hrilhtu che u avâng leh chhia leh ṭha hriatna avângin ei suh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />in chhia leh ṭha hriatna thu ka sawi lo va, mi dang chhia leh ṭha hriatna thu ka sawi zâwk a ni. A nih leh, ka zalênna chu mi dang ngaih dânin a dîpdâl tûr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lâwm taka ka eia, a chunga lâwmthu ka sawina thilah hian engah nge sawichhiat ka nih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan in ei emaw, in in emaw, thil in ti emaw, in tih apiangah Pathian ropuina tûr hlîrin ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Juda te, Grik te leh Pathian kohhran te ngaihmawh zâwngin awm suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />kei pawhin mahni hlâwkna zawng lovin, chhandam an nih theih nân mi tam tak ṭhatna zawng zâwkin, kawng tinrênga mi dang ka tilâwm ṭhîn ang hian.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keiin Krista ka entawn ang hian nangni pawhin mi entawn ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkimah mi hriat reng ṭhin avâng leh pawm zêl tûr thu ka hrilh che u ang taka in awm avângin ka fak a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hei hi in hriat ka duh: Mipa tawh phawt lu chu Krista a ni a, hmeichhe lu chu mipa a ni a, Krista lu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipa, lukhum khum chunga ṭawngṭai emaw, thu hril emaw apiang chuan an lu an timualpho a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hmeichhia, lukhum khum lova ṭawngṭai emaw, thu hril emaw apiang pawhin an lu an timualpho a ni, chutiang chu meh kâwn nên thuhmun reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmeichhiain lukhum a khum duh loh chuan mêt law law rawh se. Amaherawhchu, hmeichhe tân lu meh leh ziah kâwn a zahthlâk si chuan lukhum khum rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipa erawh chu Pathian anpui leh ropuina tilangtu a nih avângin lukhum khum tûr a ni lo; hmeichhia erawh chu mipa ropuina tilangtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipa hi hmeichhia aṭanga siam a ni lo va, hmeichhia erawh chu mipa aṭanga siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipa hi hmeichhe tâna siam a ni lo va, hmeichhia erawh chu mipa tâna siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, vântirhkohte avângin hmeichhiain an lu-ah mipa thuneih chhinchhiahna an khum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpaah chuan hmeichhia hi mipa tel lo chuan an awm thei lo va, mipa pawh hmeichhe tel lovin an awm thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmeichhia hi mipa aṭanga siam a ni ang bawkin, mipa hi hmeichhe laka piang a ni si a; nimahsela, engkim hi Pathian aṭanga chhuak vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngaihtuah teh mah u, hmeichhia lukhum khum lova Pathian hnêna ṭawngṭai chu a âwm rêng rêng em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipain sam sei a neih chuan a tân thil zahthlâk a ni tih in rilru pianpui pawhin in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmeichhiain sam sei a neih erawh chuan amah chawimawitu a ni, a sam chu amah khuh nân pêk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, hei hi in hnial a nih pawhin, keinin emaw, Pathian kohhranten emaw chutiang kawngah dân kan nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He zirtîrna zawm thu-ah erawh hi chuan ka fak thei lo va che u, in inkhâwm hi ṭhatpui ahnêkin in chhiat phah zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmasa berin, Kohhranho in inkhâwmnaah inṭhenna a awm ṭhîn tih ka lo hria a, rin pawh ka ring deuh bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In zînga mi dik takte an lan chian theih nân, ngaih dân hrang nei an awm chu a âwm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hei vâng hian in inkhâwmna chu Lalpa Zanriah kîlna chi a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi tinin mahni zanriah tûr in rawn keng a, mahniin in ei a, ṭhenkhat an ril a ṭâm a, ṭhenkhat an rui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutianga ei leh inna tûr mahni in in nei ṭheuh a ni lâwm ni? A nih leh, Pathian Kohhran hmusitin nei lote chu tihzah in tum em ni? Eng nge ka sawi tâk ang? Ka fak dâwn che u em ni? He thu-ah hi zawng ka fak thei lo va che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka thu hrilh chhâwn che u hi, Lalpa hnên ata ka dawn asin; khatia, mantîra a awm zâna, Lalpa Isuan chhang a lâka, lâwmthu a sawi zawha, a phela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hei hi ka taksa a ni, in tân a ni e, mi hriat reng nân heti hian ti ṭhîn rawh u,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, an ei zawhah, no pawh chu a la a, “He no hi ka thisena thuthlung thar chu a ni, in in apiangin mi hriat reng nân ti ṭhîn rawh u,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu chhang chu in eia, no chu in in apiangin, a lo kal leh hma loh zawng, Lalpa thihna chu in puang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, tu pawh tlâk lo chunga Lalpa chhang hi eia, a no hi in apiang chuan Lalpa taksa leh thisenah thiam loh an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tin mahni infiah ṭheuh sela, chutiangin chhang chu eiin no chu in rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ei leh intu chuan Lalpa taksa awmzia a hriat loh chuan mahni chunga rorêlna thlen tûrin a eiin a in a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian in zînga tam tak in chak lovin in bawrhsâwm a, in muhîl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mahni inenfiah hmasa ṭhîn ila chuan rorêlsakin kan awm lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rorêlsaka kan awm pawhin, khawvêl mite nên thiam loh kan chan ve loh nân Lalpan min thunun ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka unaute u, Lalpa Zanriah kîl tûra in inkhâwmin innghâk ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rilṭâm an awm chuan inah ei zet rawh se; tichuan, in inkhâwm chu thiam loh in chan phah dâwn lo nia. Thil dang erawh chu ka lo kal hunah ka rawn tifel ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, Thlarau lam thilpêk thu hi in hriat loh ka duh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jentail mi in nih lai khân milem ṭawng thei hlei lo lamah an hruai bo ṭhîn che u tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, hei hi ka hriattîr a che u: Pathian Thlarauvah chuan tu mahin, “Isua chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,” an ti thei lo va, Thlarau Thianghlimah lo chuan, “Isua chu Lalpa,” an ti thei bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, thilpêk chi hrang hrang a awm a, chûng chu Thlarau pakhata mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rawngbâwlna chi hrang hrang pawh a awm a, Lalpa pakhat tân a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thiltihtheihna pawh chi hrang hrang a awm a, Pathian pakhat hnêna mi a ni, mi tin hnêna thiltihtheihna pe ṭhîntu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sâwt tlânna tûrin mi tin hnênah Thlarau inhriattîrna chu a lo thleng ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlarau zârah mi ṭhenkhat hnênah thu fing sawi theihna pêk a ni a, mi dang hnênah chu Thlarau vêkah chuan thu hriat theihna pêk a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi dang hnênah chu Thlarauvah bawk chuan rinna pêk a ni a, chu Thlarau vêkah chuan mi dang hnênah tihdam theihna pêk a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi dang hnênah thil mak tih theihna pêk a ni a, mi dang hnênah thu hril theihna pêk a ni a, mi dang hnênah Thlarau dik leh dik lo hriat theihna pêk a ni a, mi dang hnênah ṭawnghriatloh chi hrang hrang pêk a ni a, mi dang hnênah ṭawnghriatloh hrilh fiah theihna pêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi Thlarau pakhat hnathawh vek a ni a, a duh ang takin mi tin hnênah thilpêk chi hrang hrang a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taksa hi pakhat a ni a, pêng tam tak a nei a; taksa pêng zawng zawng chu tam hle mah se, taksa pakhat a ni ang hian, Krista pawh chutiang chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan za-in Juda kan ni emaw, Grik kan ni emaw, bawih kan ni emaw, ni lo emaw, pumkhata awm tûrin Thlarau pakhata baptis kan ni a, Thlarau pakhat min intîr ṭheuh bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Taksa hi pêng khat chauh ni lovin, pêng tam tak a ni zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ke hian, “Kut ka nih loh avângin taksaa tel ka ni lo ve,” ti ta sela, chumi avâng chuan taksaa tel lo a ni chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Beng hian, “Mit ka nih loh avângin taksaa tel ka ni lo ve,” ti ta sela, chumi avâng chuan taksaa tel lo a ni chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Taksa pum pui hi mit ni ta vek sela, engtin nge ri kan hriat ang? Beng ni ta vek sela, engtin nge rim kan hriat ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathianin pêng hrang hrang hi taksaah hian ṭûl a tihna apiangah a dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An vaiin pêng khat chauh ni ta sela, taksa a awm thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pêng hrang hrang tam tak awm mah se, taksa chu pumkhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, mit hian kut hnênah, “Ka mamawh lo va che,” a ti thei lo; lu pawhin ke hnênah, “Ka mamawh lo va che,” a ti thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Taksa pêng chak lo zâwka langte hi an pawimawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan taksa pêng hmuhsitawm deuhva kan ngaihte hi, chûng ngei chu kan ngai pawimawh a, nasa takin kan chei ṭhîn a, a lang mawi lote chu kan cheimawi zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan pêng mawi zâwkte chu chei pawh a ngai hlei nêm. Pathianin taksa hi a rem khâwm a, sitawm deuhte chu a chawimawi zâwk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />taksaah inhranna a awm lohva, a pêng hrang hrangte an inngaihtuah tawn theih nân a rem khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pêng pakhatin a tuar chuan pêng zawng zawngin an tuar ve vek a, pêng pakhat chawimawi a nih chuan pêng zawng zawng pawh an lâwm ve vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangniho hi Krista taksa chu in ni a, a pêngte in ni ṭheuh bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathianin a kohhranah hêng mite hi a dah a: a pakhatnaah Tirhkohte, a pahnihnaah Zâwlneite, pathumnaah Zirtîrtute, a dawtah thil mak ti theite, a dawt lehah tihdamna thilpêk neite, mi ṭanpui peihte, rorêl thiamte, ṭawnghriatloh chi hrang hrang neite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An za-in tirhkoh an ni vek em ni? An za-in zâwlnei an ni vek em ni? An za-in zirtîrtu an ni vek em ni? An za-in thil mak an ti thei vek em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tihdam theihna thilpêk an dawng vek lo va, ṭawnghriatlohvin an ṭawng vek lo va, a hrilh fiah theihna an dawng vek hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thlarau thilpêk pawimawh zâwkte chu dawn châk hle rawh u. Kawng ṭha ber ka han entîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihring ṭawngte leh vântirhkoh ṭawngtein thu sawi thei mah ila, hmangaihna ka neih si loh chuan, dâr ri ang emaw, dârbenthek ri ang emaw chauh ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu hril theihna neiin, thu ril zawng zawng leh hriat tûr zawng zawng hre vek mah ila, tlâng sawn theihna khawpa rinna nasa nei mah ila, hmangaihna ka neih si loh chuan eng mah ka ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka neih zawng zawng mi retheite tân pe vek mah ila, hâl tûrin ka taksa pawh inpe mah ila, hmangaihna ka neih si loh chuan ka tân eng mah a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmangaihnain a dawhthei a, ngil a nei bawk ṭhîn; hmangaihnain a îtsîk lo va, a infak lo va, a uang lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mawi lo takin a che lo va, mahni hma a sial ngai hek lo; a thinur duh lo va, thil sual a hre reng ngai hek lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hmangaihna chu thil dik lovah a lâwm lo va, thutak erawh chu a hlimpui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engkim a tuar hrâm hrâm a, rinnain a khat a, a beisei tlat a, engkim a tuar chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmangaihna hi eng tikah mah a dai lo vang; thuhrilnate erawh hi chu tihbân a la ni ang a; ṭawnghriatlohte pawh a la bo vang a, hriatnate pawh hi a la tâwp dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ṭhen chauh kan hria a, a ṭhen chauh kan hril rih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A famkim a lo thlen hunah erawh chuan a ṭhen chauhva kan hriat hi a famkim tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka naupan lai khân naupang ṭawngin ka ṭawng a, naupang rilru ka pu a, naupang ngaihtuah dân angin thil ka ngaihtuah ṭhîn; ka lo puitlin hnu erawh hi chuan naupang tih dân chu ka bân tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tûnah zawng dârthlalanga lang riai ruai ang chauhvin kan hmu rih a, nakinah erawh chuan inhmatawnin ka hmu tawh ang. Tûnah zawng a ṭhen chauh kan hre rih a, nakinah chuan Pathianin min hre chiang ang hian kan la hre chiang ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng thil pathum - rinna te, beiseina te leh hmangaihna te hi a awm reng dâwn, hêngahte hian a ropui ber chu hmangaihna hi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmangaihna hi ûm zêl rawh u; thlarau lam thilpêkte chu dawn châk zêl bawk ula, thu hril theihna neih phei chu châk lehzual rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭawnghriatlohva thu sawitu chuan mi dang hnêna sawi lovin Pathian hnêna sawi a ni a, tu man a thu sawi awmzia an hre thei lo, Thlarauvah thurûk a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuhriltu erawh chuan mite hnênah thu a sawi a, a tisâwt a, a fuih a, a thlamuan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭawnghriatlohva thu sawitu chuan ama tâna sâwt tûr a sawi ṭhîn a, thuhriltu erawh chuan kohhran tâna sâwt tûr a sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭawnghriatloh nei vek ula ka ti hle, thu hril theihna phei chu nei vek ula ka ti lehzual a ni. Kohhran hlâwkpui tûra hrilh fiahsaktu an awm si loh chuan ṭawnghriatloh neite ai chuan thuhrilna neite chu an ṭangkai zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute u, tûnah in hnênah lo kal ila, ṭawnghriatlohvin thu rawn sawi ta ila, thu ka puang emaw, ka hriattîr che u emaw, ka hril emaw, ka zirtîr che u emaw a nih si loh chuan in tân a hlâwk dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ri thei, nunna nei lo, hêng phênglâwng leh ṭingṭangte pawh hi awmze nei lova an tum chuan eng hla nge an sak tu nge hre thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt pawh mumal neia an ham loh chuan tu nge râl do tûrin insiam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin ṭawnghriatlohva in thu sawi chu hriat mai theih a nih si loh chuan tu nge hrethiam ang? Ṭawng mai mai in ni ang asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian ṭawng chi hrang hrang a tam hle a ni thei e, awmze nei lo pakhat mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thu sawi awmzia ka hriat si loh chuan ani chu ka tân ram dang mi ang a ni dâwn a, kei pawh a tân ram dang mi ka ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, thlarau thilpêk dawn châk zêl ula, Kohhran tihphuisuina tûr thlarau thilpek in ngah theih nân zawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvangin, ṭawnghriatloh neite chuan a hrilh fiah theihna dîl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ṭawnghriatlohva ka ṭawngṭai chuan ka thlarau chu a ṭawngṭai ngei na a, ka ngaihtuahna erawh chu ka hmang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engtin nge ni ta ang le? Thlarauvin ka ṭawngṭai ang a, ngaihtuahna hmangin ka ṭawngṭai bawk ang. Fakna hla pawh thlarauvin ka sa ang a, ngaihtuahna hmangin ka sa bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlarauvin lâwmthu sawi ta ila, ringlote ṭhutnaa ṭhute chuan i thu sawi awmzia an hre dâwn si lo va, engtin nge i lâwmthu sawiah ‘Amen,’ an tih theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I lâwmthu sawi ṭawngṭaina chu a ṭha hle a ni thei e; mahse, mi dang a tisâwt si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangni aia ṭawnghriatloh ka hman tam zâwk avângin Pathian chungah ka lâwm hle a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mahse, Kohhran inkhâwmnaah chuan mi dang zirtîr nân ṭawnghriatlohva thu sîngkhat sawi aiin ngaihtuahna hmanga thu panga lek sawi ka duh zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unaute u, naupang takin thil ngaihtuah suh u; sual lamah chuan nausên ang ni ula, ngaihtuahnaah erawh chuan puitling takin awm rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Ṭawnghriatloh hmang mite hmuiin He mite hnênah hian thu ka sawi ang a, Chuti pawhin an ngaithla lo vang,’ Lalpan a ti,” tiin Lehkha Thu-ah te ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, ṭawnghriatloh hi ringlo mite tân chhinchhiahna a ni a, ringtute tân zawng a ni ve lo; chutiang bawkin thu hril hi ringtute tân chhinchhiahna a ni a, ringlote tân zawng a ni ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kohhran pum pui inkhâwmnaah in vaiin ṭawnghriatlohvin thu lo sawi ta ula, la hre lote emaw, ringlo emaw lo lut ta sela, in â ta emaw an ti dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In za-in thu lo hril ta ula chu, ringlo emaw, hre lo emaw lo lût ve te chu in thu chuan a khawih ang a, an sualzia a hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An thinlunga thurûkte chu tihlan a ni ang a, Pathian chibai bûkin an bawkkhup ang a, “In zîngah Pathian a lo awm takzet a ni,” tiin an puang zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute u, inkhâwmnaah hla nei te, zirtîrna nei te, thu puan tûr nei te, ṭawnghriatlohva ṭawng ṭûl te, hrilhfiahna nei te in awm si chuan engtia tih tûr nge ni ang? Kohhran siam ṭha zâwnga tih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ṭawnghriatlohva thu in sawiin mi pahnih pathum bâkin thu sawi suh se, a indawtin sawi sela, pakhatin hrilh fiah rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hrilhfiahtu an awm loh chuan inkhâwmnaah chuan ngawi mai sela, a fâlin Pathian hnênah sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thu hril pawh pahnih pathum chauhvin hril sela, mi dangin chîk takin lo ngaithla rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ngaithlatute zîngah thu puan tûr nei an awm chuan a sawi hmasatu chu ngawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A indawtin thu hril ṭhîn ula; tichuan, mi tinin zir tûr in nei thei ang a, mi tin in thlamuan thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuhriltute thuhril theihna thlarau chu an thuhnuaiah a awm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian chu buaina Pathian a ni lo va, remna Pathian a ni zâwk. Kohhran tina Pathian mi thianghlimte tih dân angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kohhran inkhâwmnaah hmeichhiate chu ngawi reng rawh se, thu an sawi ve phal a ni lo ve. Dân buin a sawi angin thu an zâwm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thil hriat duh an neih chuan in lamah an pasalte zâwt rawh se. Hmeichhe tân Pathian kohhran inkhâwmnaa thu sawi hi a zahthlâk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian thu hi nangmahni aṭanga chhuak em ni? A nih leh, in hnênah chauh em ni a lo thlen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tu pawhin zâwlnei emaw, thlarau mi emaw nia an inngaih chuan in hnêna ka lehkha hi Lalpa thupêk a ni tih lo hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu pawhin an pawisak loh chuan ngaihsak suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka unaute u, thu hril hi châk hle ula, ṭawnghriatlohva thu sawi pawh khap suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, engkim fel tak leh awmze nei taka tih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, in hnêna Chanchin Ṭha ka rawn hril in lo pawm a, in innghah tâkna kha ka hriattîr leh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha ka hrilh che u ngei kha in pawm reng chuan chhandam in ni ang a, in pawm reng loh chuan in rinna chu a thlâwn a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng hi ka thu dawn pawimawh ber ka hrilh chhâwn che u kha a ni; Krista chu Lehkha Thu ang zêlin kan sualte avângin a thi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />phûmin a awm a, Lehkha Thu angin ni thum ni-ah kaihthawh a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Petera hnênah a inlâr a, Sâwmpahnihte hnênah pawh a inlâr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chumi hnuah, ṭum khatah, unau zanga aia tam hnênah a inlâr leh a, chûng zînga a tam zâwk chu an la dam a, ṭhenkhat erawh chu an muhîl ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakoba hnênah a inlâr leh a, chumi hnuah chuan tirhkoh zawng zawng hnênah a inlâr leh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan, kei, a hun lova piang ang mai hnênah pawh a rawn inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei zawng, tirhkoh zînga tê ber ka ni, Pathian kohhran ka tihduhdah avângin tirhkohva vuah tlâk pawh ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian khawngaihna avângin ka nih nih ka ni ta. A khawngaihna mi pêk hi a thlâwnin a awm lo ve, tirhkoh dangte aiin ka thawk nasa zâwk asin; nimahsela, keia thawh a ni lo va, ka hnêna awm Pathian khawngaihna thawh a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, kei pawhin, anni pawhin khati khân kan hril ṭhîn a, nangni pawhin chu ngei chu in ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Krista chu mitthi zîng ata kaih thawh a nih thu kan hril a, in zînga ṭhenkhatin engati nge mitthi thawhlehna a awm lo in tih theih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mitthi thawhlehna a awm si loh chuan Krista pawh kha kaihthawh a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista kha kaihthawh a nih si loh chuan kan thu hril hi dâwt a ni ang a, dâwt ring lek in ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathianin Krista chu mitthi zîng ata a kaitho tih kan hril a, mitthi thawhlehna a awm si loh chuan Krista pawh kaihthawh a ni lo vang a, Pathian chungchâng thu-ah dâwt kan sawi a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mitthite kaihthawh an nih loh chuan, Krista pawh kha kaihthawh a ni bîk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista chu kaihthawh a nih si loh chuan in rinna hi eng mah a ni lo va, in sualnaah in la awm reng a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuti a nih chuan Kristaa muhîl tate pawh kha an boral ta a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kristaa beisei kan neih hi tûn dam chhûng atân chauh ni ta se, mi zawng zawnga khawngaihthlâk ber kan ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, Krista chu mitthi zîng ata kaihthawh a ni takzet a ni, mitthite thawh hmahruaitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring avângin thihna a lo awm a, mihring avâng vêkin thawhlehna pawh a lo awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adama-ah mi zawng zawng an thi ang khân, Kristaah mi zawng zawng tihnun leh an ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mahni hun ṭheuhvah a ni ang. Thawh hmahruaitu Krista chu a tho hmasa a, a dawtah, a lo kal leh hunah, ama mite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi zawhah tâwpna chu a lo thleng ang. Rorêlna te, thuneihna te, thiltihtheihna zawng zawng te a tihbo hunah Pa, Pathian hnên ngeiah Ram chu a hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathianin hmêlma zawng zawng a hneha, a ke hnuaia a dah vek hma chu Krista chuan ro a rêl dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmêlma hnuhnûng ber tihbova awm tûr chu thihna hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathianin, “Engkim a ke hnuaiah a dah,” tih a ni. Heta, ‘engkim’ tihah hian, Krista ke hnuaia engkim dahtu Pathian chu a tel ve lo tih a lang chiang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hnuaia engkim dah a nih hnuah, amah, Fapa ngei chu, a hnuaia engkim dahtu Pathian hnuaiah dah a ni ang a; Pathian chu engkima chungnung ber a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nih leh, thawhlehna hi awm lo ni se, engah nge mitthi puala baptisma an chan ang? Mitthite kaihthawh an nih dâwn si loh chuan engati nge an puala baptisma an chan ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eng vângin nge keini pawh hi dârkâr tin thih hlauhthâwnawma kan awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Unaute u, kan Lalpa Krista Isuaa ka chhuan êm che u avângin, ni tin thihna ka hmachhawn tih ka hrilh che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihring tih dân angin Efesi khuaa sakawlhte kha sual ka nih chuan ka tân eng nge sâwt ang? Mitthite kaihthawh an nih dâwn loh chuan, “I eiin i in ang, natûkah kan thi mai dâwn si a,” an tih ang hian i awm ve mai ang u hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hruai bovin awm suh u, “Ṭhian sualin nungchang ṭha an tikhawlo ṭhîn,” tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Harh fîm ula, thil sual ti tawh suh u. Ṭhenkhat chuan Pathian hriatna rêng in neih loh hi, hei hi in zahna tûrin ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Engtin nge mitthite chu kaihthawh an nih ang? Eng ang taksa nge an put ang?’ tiin in zâwt a ni thei e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu chu zawhna âtthlâk tak a ni. Leia chi in tuh pawh hi a thih zet loh chuan a ṭo ngai hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Buh chi emaw, thil dang chi emaw in tuh a ni thei e, in chi tuh chu a kûng lo la awm tûr chu a ni lo va, a fang mai a la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pathianin a duh angin kûng a siamsak a, thlai chi hrang hrangin kûng chi hrang hrang an nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tisa zawng zawng hi tisa chi khat a ni hek lo, mihring tisa a dang a, ran tisa a dang a, sava tisa a dang a, sangha tisa pawh a dang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vân taksa a awm a, lei taksa pawh a awm bawk a; vân taksa ropui dân leh lei taksa ropui dân pawh a inang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ni hian ama ropuina a nei a, thlain ropuina hran a nei a, arsi pawhin ropuina hrang a nei, arsi hrang hrang ropui dân pawh a inang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mitthi thawhlehna pawh chutiang bawk chu a ni ang. Ṭawih thei kha phûm a ni a, ṭawih thei lova kaihthawh a ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />hmuhsitawm tak kha phûm a ni a, ropui taka kaihthawh a ni ang; chak lo tak kha phûm a ni a, thiltithei taka kaihthawh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kan phûm kha mihring lam taksa a ni a, kaihthawha awm tûr chu thlarau lam taksa a ni. Mihring lam taksa a awm chuan thlarau lam taksa pawh a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lehkha Thu chuan, “Mihring hmasa ber Adama chu mi nung a lo ni ta a,” a ti a; Adama hnuhnûng ber chu nunna petu Thlarau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Thlarau lam a hmasa lo va, mihring lam a awm hmasa a, chumi hnuah thlarau lam a lo awm chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihring hmasa chu leia siam, leia mi a ni a, mihring pahnihna chu vâna mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Leia siamte chu leia siama ang kha an ni a, vâna mite erawh chu vâna mi ang kha an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Leia siama ang kha kan nih angin vâna mi ang kha kan la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Unaute u, tisa leh thisen hian Pathian ram chu a luah thei lo va, ṭawih thei hian ṭawih thei lo chu a luah dâwn lo tih ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thu ril ka hrilh dâwn che u hi: Kan za-in kan muhîl vek lo vang a; nimahsela, tawtawrâwt hnuhnûng ber rîk hunah chuan thâwklehkhatah, mitkhapkâr lovah tihdanglam kan ni vek ang. Tawtawrâwt chu a lo rîk hun chuan mitthite chu ṭawih thei lova kaihthawh an ni ang a, keini pawh tihdanglam kan ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ṭawih thei hi ṭawih thei lovah a chang ang a, thi thei hi thi thei lovah a chang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chutianga ṭawih thei hi ṭawih thei lova a chana, thi thei hi thi thei lova a chan hunah chuan he Lehkha Thu: “Thihna chu hnehnain a lem zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aw thihna, khaw nge i hnehna chu? Aw thihna, khawiah nge i tûr chu?” tih hi a lo thleng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Thihna tûr chu sual hi a ni a, sual thiltihtheihna chu Dân hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mahse, kan Lalpa Isua Krista zâra hnehna min petu Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Chutichuan, unau duh takte u, tihchêt rual lohvin ding nghet ula, in thawhrimna chu a thlâwn dâwn lo tih hriain Lalpa hna ṭhahnemngai takin thawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte tâna thawhlâwm thu-ah chuan Galatia rama kohhrante ka hrilh angin ti ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianni apiangin in zînga tu pawhin malsâwmna in dawn ang zêlin dah khâwl ṭheuh ula, ka lo kal hunah thawhlâwm khawn a ngaih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lo kal hunah in thil pêkte chu Jerusalem-a kalpui tûrin in mi rinzâwngte chu lehkha keng chuan ka kaltîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kal ve a ṭûl chuan kan kal ho dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Makedonia ram ka fan hnuin ka rawn tlawh ang che u; Makedonia ram fan a ṭûl tho si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In hnênah rei tak ka châm mai thei, thlasik chhûng zawng pawh a ni mai thei e; tin, nangnin ka kal leh zêlna tûrah pawh min pui dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûna kal paha hmuh zawk che u mai chu ka duh tâwk lo va, Lalpan rem a tih chuan rei tak in hnêna châm theih ka inbeisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efesi khuaah hian Pentikos ni thlengin ka châm rih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dodâltu tam tak awm mah se, hetah hian hlâwk taka rawngbâwl theihna remchâng a inhawng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Timothea hi in hnên a lo thlen hunah, in zîngah inthlahrung lovin awmtîr ang che u, keimah ang bawka Lalpa hna ṭhahnemngai taka thawktu a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, tu man lo ngainêp suh u. Ka hnênah hlim taka a lo kîr leh theih nân lo ṭanpui ang che u; unau dang ruala a lo thlen ka beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaupa Apolova erawh chu unau dangte ruala in hnêna lo kal tûrin ka ngên chiam a; mahse, tûnah chuan a duh rih lo tlat a, hun remchâng dangah a lo la kal ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Inring rengin awm ula, rinnaah ding nghet ula, huai tak leh chak takin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In tih apiang chu hmangaihnaa tih ni zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Stefana te chhûng kha Akaia rama ring hmasa an ni a, mi thianghlimte rawngbâwl hnaah an inpe zo tih in hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chutiang mite leh an thawhpuite leh an rawngbâwlpuite thu chu zâwm zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Stefana te, Fortunata te, Akaika te lo kal hian mi tilâwm hle a ni; anni hian in awm loh pawh lang lovin mi siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />in rilru an tiharh ang khân kei pawh mi tiharh a, hetiang mite hi ngaihlu rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia ram kohhrante hian chibai an bûk a che u. Akuila leh Priskili leh an ina kohhran inkhâwmte hian Lalpa hmingin chibai an bûk mawlh mawlh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unau zawng zawngte pawh hian chibai an bûk a che u; fawh thianghlimin inchibai tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi, kei Paulan, keima kut ngeia chibai ka bûkna che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu pawh, Lalpa hmangaih lo chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se. Lalpa chu a lo kal e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista Isuaah chuan ka hmangaihna in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
